EVALUATION PROTOCOL
------------------------------------------------------------------------
  held-out layouts : 200, seeds 900,000,000 .. 900,000,199
  disjoint from    : training, which uses SEED*1,000,000 + episode
  policy           : DETERMINISTIC (actor mean, no sampling)
  measure          : D = H(f_bar) - mean_i H(f_i), bits
                     tokens = nearest landmark, from obs[4:10]
                     bound  = log2 min(N,|A|) = 1.5850 bits
  empirical zero   : permutation null, 25 shuffles per layout
  statistic        : matched-return Delta D, reported under
                     branch = ascending (primary, pre-registered)
                     branch = any        (declared secondary)

